		(uuid "c96454f6-a9bd-4659-b72e-5ff9ea655780")
	)
	(text "Keypad 2 x 6 for JC8012P4A1C_I_W_Y, variant 2 (keypad right of the display, seen from the front).\n3 x 4 matrix, one diode per key (no ghost keys), esp-iot-solution keyboard_button:\noutputs drive high one after another, inputs with internal pull-down, active_level = 1.\n\nJ1 -> FFC 1:1 -> FPC4 EXTEND2 of the display board (pin n = GPIO 22+n):\npin 6 GPIO28 IN0, pin 7 GPIO29 IN2, pin 8 GPIO30 OUT1, pin 9 GPIO31 OUT0,\npin 10 GPIO32 OUT2, pin 11 GPIO33 IN3, pin 12 GPIO34 IN1.\nPins 1, 2 (GND) and 13, 14 (VDDA) are not used.\n\nKey Sn = Fn as on the CCI 60: S1-S6 outer column, S7-S12 inner column (next to the display), top to bottom.\nOUT0 rows 1-2, OUT1 rows 3-4, OUT2 rows 5-6.\nIN0 / IN2: inner column odd / even rows, IN1 / IN3: outer column odd / even rows.\n\nH1-H4: M2.5 spacers, screws M2.5 x 8 from behind through the frame (4 mm) and the PCB.\nLonger screws push through the foil."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
